OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor stripped of roles after
OL,4,Aconduct breaches
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Reform UK councillor has been
OL,7,Fstripped of his council committee roles
OL,8,Fafter he was sanctioned for multiple
OL,9,Fcode of conduct breaches.
OL,11,FLeicestershire County Council's Reform
OL,12,Fgroup confirmed it had taken the step
OL,13,Fafter two complaints against Joseph
OL,14,FBoam - one lodged by a former senior
OL,15,Fcouncil officer and the other by a
OL,16,FConservative councillor - were upheld
OL,17,Fat member conduct hearings on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
