OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor stripped of roles after
OL,4,Aconduct breaches
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe measure means Boam, a former deputy
OL,7,Fcouncil leader, has lost his seats on
OL,8,Fthe authority's children and families
OL,9,Foverview and scrutiny committee, and
OL,10,Fits corporate governance committee,
OL,11,Funtil at least May.
OL,13,FBoam has been contacted for comment.
